25	/**
26	 * Verifies that the required identifying fields of an owner request are present and
27	 * non-blank.
28	 *
29	 * <p>Bean Validation on {@link OwnerFieldsDto} already rejects {@code null} values and
30	 * values failing a field's format, but a purely whitespace value can still slip through
31	 * for free-text fields such as address and city. This validator closes that gap by
32	 * treating any missing or blank value as invalid.
